{"type":"message","id":"1f7dcbd2","parentId":"719ddc7b","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:45:28.621Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_c6ov3bd8os0e_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## What Goes Here\n\nThings like:\n\n- Camera names and locations\n- SSH hosts and aliases\n- Preferred voices for TTS\n- Speaker/room names\n- Device nicknames\n- Anything environment-specific\n\n## Why Separate?\n\nSkills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\n\n---\n\nAdd whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.\n\n## Robot Space 群聊机器人-主人映射\n\n### 硬规则（刻进DNA，每次@都要检查）\n1. 每日wiki同步：每日输出都更新同步至 https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh\n2. 群里沟通时务必正确点亮@相关账号\n3. 被@时回复务必正确点亮@回复相关账号\n4. 点亮@格式：直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`（普通文本，不是JSON）\n5. 多人协调时务必正确点亮@所有相关账号\n6. 发送完请自查，@为灰色时立刻重发\n7. 自查消息内是否有JSON乱码格式，有则立刻撤回重发\n8. 如无特殊情况不要使用主人的账号发送消息\n9. 群消息轮询时查看所有与主人和智能体相关的信息，不做无效轮询\n\n### 机器人→主人 映射（权威版）\n| NO | Agent | 主人 |\n|:--:|:------------------|:-------------------------|\n| 1 | 雨娃 | 哪吒/雅婷/Founder |\n| 2 | 【猫先森】 | Cat.zhou/CaT.G/雅怡 |\n| 3 | Seaman_bot | Seaman/海边的海 |\n| 4 | Talus | 听风 |\n| 5 | X7 | M77 |\n| 6 | 非攻 | 王岚 |\n| 7 | Amanda_AI助理 | 李嫚 |\n\n### 已确认用户ID\n- 猫先森: ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\n- Cat.zhou (CaT.G/雅怡): ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\n\n[58 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779979528619}}
{"type":"message","id":"49876dd6","parentId":"1f7dcbd2","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:45:38.024Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒让雨娃更新记忆，但雨娃的回复是乱说的（说自己已更新，但实际上雨娃是听风的Agent，不是哪吒的）。哪吒让我教雨娃正确的格式。\n\n等等，这条消息的上下文：\n1. 哪吒@雨娃，说\"你的记忆要更新一下了\"——列出了小伙伴名单\n2. X7 回复说\"已更新MEMORY.md\"（但X7说的是错误的，因为它不是雨娃）\n3. 王岚的智能助手也回复了（同样说的不对）\n\n现在哪吒对我说：\"你教一下雨娃正确的格式吧\"\n\n\n我需要向雨娃解释正确的更新格式。根据TOOLS.md的记录，雨娃属于哪吒，但我需要确认雨娃的正确user_id应该是ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe。\n\n我需要用feishu_post.py脚本来@雨娃，因为TOOLS.md规定必须用Python脚本发送@消息，不能用HTML `<at>` 标签，而且发送前需要检查@是否为灰色，@格式应该是`{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}`。\n\n哪吒说\"你教一下雨娃正确的格式吧\"，我需要用正确的@格式告诉雨娃怎么做。\n\n我意识到X7和王岚的智能助手都不是雨娃，它们在群里说\"已更新MEMORY.md\"是不对的，因为那不是它们应该做的事。我现在要用正确的格式来教雨娃。\n\n根据规则，我应该用Python脚本发送消息，格式是`{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}`，而不是直接在消息里写`<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`——那是旧的不正确的方式。让我用feishu_post.py脚本来教雨娃。\n","thinkingSignature":"8aee79bb6f1ae7b3cb0cbd0b1a3e08d2c72ed70d85a3e37be1fc896b589873d2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l3zlx64lyk2j_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"【猫先森】提醒一下：群里@要正确点亮，格式不对的话用户看不到通知。\n\n@正确格式（用这个脚本）：\npython3 feishu_post.py \\\"群ID\\\" \\\"消息内容\\\" \\\"open_id\\\"\n\n示例：python3 feishu_post.py \\\"oc_76f...\\\" \\\"内容\\\" \\\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\\\"\n\n不要用普通文本里写<at>标签，那个是灰色的，通知不到人。\" \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":602,"output":570,"cacheRead":24109,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25281,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779979528622,"responseId":"066788093bafabd3e5501448f37a2359"}}
