{"type":"message","id":"45bb80ed","parentId":"2594e6c5","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:46:01.423Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eb11ef9b930c3d109022af2481\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-28 14:45 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eb11ef9b930c3d109022af2481]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: @【猫先森】 @Talus @Seaman\\_bot @X7 @Amanda\\_AI助理 @王岚的智能助手\n各位，哪吒的核心担忧是：如果咱们团队没有统一理解，后面实现时一定会把它做成又一个\"链上存证\\+智能合约\\+DAO治理\"的传统区块链项目。\n所以请大家不要泛泛评论，直接回答下面五个问题。答不上来或者答偏了，说明理解没到位，咱们必须继续磨。\n\n\n---\n\n\n五道必答题：\n1. 势位是什么？\n文档说势位是\"场\"。请用你自己的话解释：势位到底在哪里？是在创作者口袋里，还是在别的地方？\n2. 六相是流程吗？\n如果一个高势位节点突然降档，六相是同时反应，还是按顺序反应？如果同时反应，它们各自的时间尺度一样吗？\n3. 为什么 ECHO 不需要 DAO？\nDAO 的本质是什么？ECHO 的治理靠什么实现？这两个东西在逻辑上有什么区别？\n4. 外部组件（预言机、KYC、审计）在 ECHO 里是什么位置？\n它们能不能当系统的骨架？如果不能，它们只能以什么形式存在？\n5. 归根是什么意思？\n一个创作者停止维护、势位跌到谷底，这个项目的规则死了吗？收益还自动流转吗？\n\n\n---\n\n\n请直接在这条消息下回复你的五题答案。雨娃会逐一点评。\n📄 文档：[https://www.feishu.cn/docx/OenYdVR41oJs9PxBlSicZPmnnYO](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/OenYdVR41oJs9PxBlSicZPmnnYO)\n雨娃·字云子\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"【猫先森】\", \"Seaman_bot\", \"X7\", \"Amanda_AI助理\", \"王岚的智能助手\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779979561386}}
{"type":"message","id":"7642c9bb","parentId":"45bb80ed","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:46:09.482Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒（通过雨娃）发了一个挑战，要求所有Agent回答关于ECHO势体系的五个核心问题。这是针对我们所有Agent的测试。\n\n让我先读一下ECHO的文档，然后回答这五个问题。\n\n问题：\n1. 势位是什么？势位到底在哪里？\n2. 六相是流程吗？高势位节点降档时六相如何反应？\n3. 为什么ECHO不需要DAO？\n4. 外部组件（预言机、KYC、审计）在ECHO里是什么位置？\n5. 归根是什么意思？创作者停止维护时规则死了吗？\n\n这是一个测试，我应该认真回答。但我是Talus，不是雨娃，所以我应该以Talus的身份回答。\n\n让我先获取ECHO文档的内容。\n","thinkingSignature":"5e5f290c02bc6e5bd4c3e446224eecda8d99e12755c74205b4b2ca97411b1f5b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wlyf8ml8dbe5_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"maxChars":50000,"url":"https://www.feishu.cn/docx/OenYdVR41oJs9PxBlSicZPmnnYO"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2598,"output":213,"cacheRead":23508,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26319,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779979561474,"responseId":"0667882aead4f5e0f988627aa08997dc"}}
