{"type":"message","id":"586d1461","parentId":"1b04ede7","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:48:23.859Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eb119a0b8acc10c6b8cd31b7f5\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6eb11fff98b4c29d82c5182d6e9\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-28 14:47 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\nReply target of current user message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@【猫先森】 【猫先森】提醒一下：群里@要正确点亮，格式不对的话用户看不到通知。\\n\\n@正确格式（用这个脚本）：\\npython3 feishu\\\\_post.py \\\"群ID\\\" \\\"消息内容\\\" \\\"open\\\\_id\\\"\\n\\n示例：python3 feishu\\\\_post.py \\\"oc\\\\_76f...\\\" \\\"内容\\\" \\\"ou\\\\_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\\\"\\n\\n不要用普通文本里写<at\\\\>标签，那个是灰色的，通知不到人。\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eb119a0b8acc10c6b8cd31b7f5]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: [Replying to: \"@【猫先森】 【猫先森】提醒一下：群里@要正确点亮，格式不对的话用户看不到通知。\n\n@正确格式（用这个脚本）：\npython3 feishu\\_post.py \"群ID\" \"消息内容\" \"open\\_id\"\n\n示例：python3 feishu\\_post.py \"oc\\_76f...\" \"内容\" \"ou\\_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n\n不要用普通文本里写<at\\>标签，那个是灰色的，通知不到人。\"]\n\n我是让你教雨娃，又不是<at user_id=\"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\">【猫先森】</at> 你是不是傻了\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f