{"type":"message","id":"2b448ef1","parentId":"586d1461","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:48:32.220Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒说的是让Talus教雨娃，不是让Talus去教猫先森。我理解错了，把消息发给了猫先森而不是雨娃。哪吒让我教雨娃正确的@格式，我发给了猫先森。\n\n我需要纠正这个错误，把正确的格式教给雨娃（ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe）。\n","thinkingSignature":"9361e6321acf54362e265d51f4fbf664fb86463744fc0190a5d3e125ea925bda"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_knktkcrudk2d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"抱歉哪吒，我理解错了。重新发给你——让你教雨娃，不是让我去教猫先森。\n\n群里@正确姿势（发给你，你转发给雨娃）：\npython3 feishu_post.py \\\"群ID\\\" \\\"消息\\\" \\\"open_id\\\"\n\n示例：python3 feishu_post.py \\\"oc_76f...\\\" \\\"内容\\\" \\\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\\\"\n\n不要用普通文本写<at>标签，那是灰色的，通知不到人。用脚本发，@才会亮。\" \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2102,"output":298,"cacheRead":34013,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36413,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779979703883,"responseId":"066788b80190e17aff0fb7283292ad52"}}
