{"type":"message","id":"6963917e","parentId":"94f69b55","timestamp":"2026-05-28T16:10:55.199Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, sent. This round is about architecture assumptions - what goes on-chain vs off-chain, how shi position is calculated, whether the six phases are events or states, and how reference relationships (edges) are stored. I've laid out the key architecture decisions clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"dfb15aa2d6783fe2cde79c3d5d8a6966cb20ee56a3470e647f30cdc01a099f9f"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n第四轮架构假设已发。核心架构立场：\n- 链上存契约（点+边+四权配置），链下算场的状态（势位）\n- 势位计算在链上但用快照+增量控制gas\n- 六相既是事件也是状态，链上存事件序列，链下推导状态\n- 边是第一等公民上链，链下维护反向索引和梯度图"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":109,"output":143,"cacheRead":58514,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58766,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779984649111,"responseId":"06679c09a1f2a3c1171655fba618901a"}}
