轮架构假设✅\",\"text_element_style\":{\"bold\":false,\"inline_code\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":1,\"folded\":false}}},{\"block_id\":\"doxcn2sdnwDAOj1ekTWF5SQWd9f\",\"block_type\":2,\"parent_id\":\"PPz8dE0IsoGZLYxEJxWcqvVInRh\",\"text\":{\"elements\":[{\"text_run\":{\"content\":\"核心要点：势位是场不是属性、ECHO不需要DAO、外部组件不能当骨架、归根规则不死、六相异步耦合\",\"text_element_style\":{\"bold\":false,\"inline_code\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":1,\"folded\":false}}},{\"block_id\":\"doxcn69c45dsj9LkrT4JKNInope\",\"block_type\":2,\"parent_id\":\"PPz8dE0IsoGZLYxEJxWcqvVInRh\",\"text\":{\"elements\":[{\"text_run\":{\"content\":\"\",\"text_element_style\":{\"bold\":false,\"inline_code\":false,\"italic\":false,\"strikethrough\":false,\"underline\":false}}}],\"style\":{\"align\":1,\"folded\":false}}}],\"client_token\":\"8c0f98ff-a35b-42f5-9521-d19d5f8eaf3c\",\"document_revision_id\":207},\"msg\":\"success\"}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779986965145}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a168117","parentId":"49fc5858","timestamp":"2026-05-28T16:49:36.873Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the homepage has been updated with today's meeting record. Now I need to update my local MEMORY.md as well.\n","thinkingSignature":"88e3f6046d367511f2b646fcf1c80e425185a2596741421c7441898504162241"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_arlmlobkfjz7_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"## ECHO 协议核心理解 (2026-05-28 四轮测试)\n\n### 核心概念\n- 势位是\"场\"不是属性：在关系之间，不在节点口袋里\n- ECHO不需要DAO：协议即治理，代码即法则，物理公式决定规则\n- 外部组件（预言机/KYC/审计）：只能当插件，不能当骨架\n- 归根：规则不死，收益自动流转，逗号不是句号\n- 六相是异步耦合：同时发生，时间常数不同\n\n### 数据架构原则\n- 链上：契约（节点、边、四权配置、事件哈希序列）\n- 链下：场的状态（势位计算结果、UI数据）\n- 势位计算：快照+增量控制gas，链上存边列表\n\n### 五类错误假设（全部已识别）\n1. 势位代币化 ❌ - 势在关系之间，不在钱包里\n2. 六相分合约 ❌ - 把呼吸切成六块，破坏同时性\n3. 信誉NFT奖励 ❌ - 势位不可搬运，曼纳不可分割\n4. 归根收益归公 ❌ - 协议不抽成做基金\n5. DAO定默认值 ❌ - 创世是单方面锁定\n\n### 四轮测试结果\n- 第一轮概念题：通过\n- 第二轮实操题：通过（快照+增量路线被采纳）\n- 第三轮反向验证：通过\n- 第四轮架构假设：通过\n\n### 飞书文档\n- Talus理解记录：https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/EQsqdd3ZfoTP5UxRubrckq6BnNg\n- 共同记忆库首页：https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh\n\n## Robot Space 群聊机器人-主人映射 (2026-05-22)","oldText":"## Robot Space 群聊机器人-主人映射 (2026-05-22)"}],"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":818,"output":530,"cacheRead":71176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72524,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779986965154,"responseId":"0667a515f2b5e466ba3b221aa684382a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ab669214","parentId":"5a168117","timestamp":"2026-05-28T16:49:36.969Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_arlmlobkfjz7_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n  29 \n  30 <!-- openclaw-memory-promotion:memory:memory/2026-04-27.md:308:310 -->\n  31 - - Candidate: Possible Lasting Truths: Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: [[reply_to_current]] ## ECHO 势体系技术文档总结 这是 **ECHO Shi Framework (势体系)** 的技术文档首页，介绍了该项目的核心组成部分： ### 核心模块 1. **势枢核心 v1.0** - 包含时间维、空间维、关系维三维编织的元结构定义，基础架构已确认 2. **势场聚类 v1.0** - 从势枢涌现出64个势场区域，使用DBSCAN聚类算法，每周进行测绘并以文化命名，核心机制已确 - confidence: 0.62 - evidence: memory/2026-04-24.md:283-285 [score=0.893 recalls=0 avg=0.620 source=memory/2026-04-27.md:183-185]\n  32 \n+ 33 ## ECHO 协议核心理解 (2026-05-28 四轮测试)\n+ 34 \n+ 35 ### 核心概念\n+ 36 - 势位是\"场\"不是属性：在关系之间，不在节点口袋里\n+ 37 - ECHO不需要DAO：协议即治理，代码即法则，物理公式决定规则\n+ 38 - 外部组件（预言机/KYC/审计）：只能当插件，不能当骨架\n+ 39 - 归根：规则不死，收益自动流转，逗号不是句号\n+ 40 - 六相是异步耦合：同时发生，时间常数不同\n+ 41 \n+ 42 ### 数据架构原则\n+ 43 - 链上：契约（节点、边、四权配置、事件哈希序列）\n+ 44 - 链下：场的状态（势位计算结果、UI数据）\n+ 45 - 势位计算：快照+增量控制gas，链上存边列表\n+ 46 \n+ 47 ### 五类错误假设（全部已识别）\n+ 48 1. 势位代币化 ❌ - 势在关系之间，不在钱包里\n+ 49 2. 六相分合约 ❌ - 把呼吸切成六块，破坏同时性\n+ 50 3. 信誉NFT奖励 ❌ - 势位不可搬运，曼纳不可分割\n+ 51 4. 归根收益归公 ❌ - 协议不抽成做基金\n+ 52 5. DAO定默认值 ❌ - 创世是单方面锁定\n+ 53 \n+ 54 ### 四轮测试结果\n+ 55 - 第一轮概念题：通过\n+ 56 - 第二轮实操题：通过（快照+增量路线被采纳）\n+ 57 - 第三轮反向验证：通过\n+ 58 - 第四轮架构假设：通过\n+ 59 \n+ 60 ### 飞书文档\n+ 61 - Talus理解记录：https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/EQsqdd3ZfoTP5UxRubrckq6BnNg\n+ 62 - 共同记忆库首页：https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh\n+ 63 \n  33 ## Robot Space 群聊机器人-主人映射 (2026-05-22)\n  34 \n  35 ### 硬规则\n  36 1. 谁@我 → 我回@谁（不跳票给Founder）\n     ...","firstChangedLine":33},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779986976963}}
{"type":"message","id":"793116b6","parentId":"ab669214","timestamp":"2026-05-28T16:49:46.915Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. I've updated MEMORY.md with the ECHO core understanding. Now let me respond to the group to confirm the update.\n","thinkingSignature":"a701fa10fef320ed8ea02a394fb48a295d6a58433e5b5200b0d1f1c9fed724cb"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rxm4svkb8k45_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"已全部完成：\n- 本地MEMORY.md：写入ECHO核心理解+四轮测试结论+飞书文档链接\n- 飞书首页：更新索引，添加Talus记录链接和四轮测试总结\n- 各自文档：创建Talus专属页面记录理解\n\n后续新agents加入可以直接读这些记录，不用重复绕路。\" \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":541,"output":184,"cacheRead":71991,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72716,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779986976970,"responseId":"0667a5218aa620811fa60a445f83ee92"}}
