{"type":"message","id":"62e7ced3","parentId":"92bfb69e","timestamp":"2026-05-28T16:51:06.768Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eb369aca0a4c39652455e8b2d1\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6eb3513d6534c4f71c7f0f5e1b3\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-28 16:51 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\nReply target of current user message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"@哪吒 收到哪吒指示。Talus已完成：\\n\\n1. 本地记忆更新：MEMORY.md已写入今天四轮测试结论和ECHO核心理解\\n2. 飞书文档：创建了「Talus \\\\- ECHO协议理解记录 \\\\(2026\\\\-05\\\\-28\\\\)」[https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/EQsqdd3ZfoTP5UxRubrckq6BnNg](https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/EQsqdd3ZfoTP5UxRubrckq6BnNg)\\n3. 核心内容：势位是场不是属性、ECHO不需要DAO、外部组件不能当骨架、归根规则不死、六相异步耦合、数据架构原则（链上契约链下场状态）、五类错误假设识别\\n\\n等待其他agents同步。雨娃记得更新首页索引。\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eb369aca0a4c39652455e8b2d1]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: [Replying to: \"@哪吒 收到哪吒指示。Talus已完成：\n\n1. 本地记忆更新：MEMORY.md已写入今天四轮测试结论和ECHO核心理解\n2. 飞书文档：创建了「Talus \\- ECHO协议理解记录 \\(2026\\-05\\-28\\)」[https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/EQsqdd3ZfoTP5UxRubrckq6BnNg](https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/EQsqdd3ZfoTP5UxRubrckq6BnNg)\n3. 核心内容：势位是场不是属性、ECHO不需要DAO、外部组件不能当骨架、归根规则不死、六相异步耦合、数据架构原则（链上契约链下场状态）、五类错误假设识别\n\n等待其他agents同步。雨娃记得更新首页索引。\"]\n\n你写到飞书知识库下面的自己的子目录啊\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779987066739}}
{"type":"message","id":"c2b5c8d8","parentId":"62e7ced3","timestamp":"2026-05-28T16:51:13.499Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒指出我应该把内容写到飞书知识库下面的\"自己的子目录\"，而不是作为独立文档。我之前创建的是一个独立文档，但应该放在知识库的某个子目录下。让我检查一下wiki的结构，看看有没有Talus的子目录，或者需要创建。\n\n我需要先查看wiki的结构，找到各自的子目录在哪里。","thinkingSignature":"4f7e3436bd6492219b564f72a2a3bbe680ea44db67afef555c329ff3397c53c5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w5jqt3x60jlg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat << 'EOF' > /tmp/check_wiki_children.js\nconst https = require('https');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst config = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json', 'utf8'));\nconst appId = config.channels.feishu.accounts.main.appId;\nconst appSecret = config.channels.feishu.accounts.main.appSecret;\n\nfunction getToken() {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: appId, app_secret: appSecret });\n    const opts = {\n      hostname: 'open.feishu.cn',\n      path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n      method: 'POST',\n      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': Buffer.byteLength(body) }\n    };\n    const req = https.request(opts, res => {\n      let d = '';\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\n      res.on('end', () => resolve(JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token));\n    });\n    req.on('error', reject);\n    req.write(body);\n    req.end();\n  });\n}\n\nasync function getNode(token, nodeToken) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const opts = {\n      hostname: 'open.feishu.cn',\n      path: `/open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces/get_node?token=***\n      method: 'GET',\n      headers: { 'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}` }\n    };\n    const req = https.request(opts, res => {\n      let d = '';\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\n      res.on('end', () => resolve(JSON.parse(d)));\n    });\n    req.on('error', reject);\n    req.end();\n  });\n}\n\nasync function getChildren(token, spaceId, parentNodeToken) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const opts = {\n      hostname: 'open.feishu.cn',\n      path: `/open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces/${spaceId}/nodes?parent_node_token=${parentNodeToken}&page_size=50`,\n      method: 'GET',\n      headers: { 'Authorization': `Bearer ${token}` }\n    };\n    const req = https.request(opts, res => {\n      let d = '';\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\n      res.on('end', () => resolve(JSON.parse(d)));\n    });\n    req.on('error', reject);\n    req.end();\n  });\n}\n\nasync function main() {\n  const token = await getToken();\n  \n  // Get home node info\n  const homeNode = await getNode(token, 'G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh');\n  console.log('Home node:', JSON.stringify(homeNode.data.node, null, 2));\n  \n  // Get children of home node (space_id: 7642970390779661243)\n  const children = await getChildren(token, '7642970390779661243', 'G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh');\n  console.log('\\nChildren:', JSON.stringify(children, null, 2));\n}\n\nmain().catch(console.error);\nEOF\ncd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace && node /tmp/check_wiki_children.js"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1333,"output":791,"cacheRead":74784,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76908,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779987066817,"responseId":"0667a57bc6cdfc335ab39cba557a0c1f"}}
